{
  "layout": "oz_research_vpp_pane",
  "note": "RESEARCH pane of the OpenZone admin window -- its own pbo and its own layout, because a server without the research mod never loads this file and the core must not know the pane exists. OZL_VppPane.OnCreate builds it under M_SUB_WIDGET and calls RegisterPane(research, RESEARCH, pane, ResHint), so the root stands at [0, vpp.paneY] and starts hidden like the core panes. Since 2026-11-09 it is the research editor (docs/specs/2026-11-09-research-editor-vpp-design.md): a row of sub-tabs, one page per sub-tab in RzPages (the script shows one), and the draft's action bar. Names the script resolves by string: every widget named Rz*, ResOwners, ResPicked, ResStatics, RzSummary, GrantType, GrantN, NodeId; ResHint is resolved by the core from the hint name handed to RegisterPane. Captions are stringtable keys of OpenZone_Research (UA original, EN).",
  "root": {"frame": {"name": "PaneResearch", "size": "$vpp.pane", "at": [0, "$vpp.paneY"], "inset": "$vpp.inset",
    "hidden": true, "priority": 2,
    "note": "Hidden: ShowPane shows the open tab's pane and hides the rest.",
    "children": [
      {"vbox": {"name": "RzBody", "gap": 8,
        "note": "Vertical budget 524 - 2 * 20 = 484: 28 (sub-tabs) + 8 + 384 (pages) + 8 + 28 (action bar) + 6 + 22 (ResHint) = 484.",
        "children": [
          {"hbox": {"name": "RzNav", "h": 28, "gap": 6,
            "note": "The sub-tabs. The script colours the open one; the button name after RzNav_ is the page key.",
            "children": [
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_overview", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_OVERVIEW", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_tree", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_TREE", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_chains", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_CHAINS", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_points", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_POINTS", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_owners", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_OWNERS", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_modules", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_MODULES", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_statics", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_STATICS", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "RzNav_settings", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TAB_SETTINGS", "font": "small"}}
            ]}},

          {"frame": {"name": "RzPages", "h": "fill",
            "note": "The pages lie on top of each other at [0, 0]; the script shows the open sub-tab's page and hides the rest.",
            "children": [

              {"frame": {"name": "RzPage_overview", "w": "fill", "h": "fill",
                "note": "The quick actions that were the whole pane before the editor: factions with their pools, grant, complete a node, reset, reload.",
                "children": [
                  {"hbox": {"name": "ResCols", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "gap": "$space.column", "children": [
                    {"vbox": {"name": "ResOwnersCol", "w": 600, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "ResOwnersHead", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_HEAD", "font": "small", "color": "$accent"}},
                      {"listbox": {"name": "ResOwners", "h": "fill", "font": "field", "color": "$text",
                        "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 12},
                        "note": "One row per faction the core's registry or a state file knows."}}
                    ]}},
                    {"vbox": {"name": "ResActsCol", "w": 340, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "ResPicked", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_PICK", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "GrantTypeLbl", "w": 90, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_PTYPE", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "GrantType", "w": 250}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "GrantNLbl", "w": 90, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_AMOUNT", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "GrantN", "w": 250}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "NodeIdLbl", "w": 90, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_NODE", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "NodeId", "w": 250}}
                      ]}},
                      {"button": {"name": "BtnGrant", "h": "$size.button", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_GRANT", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}},
                      {"button": {"name": "BtnComplete", "h": "$size.button", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_COMPLETE", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}},
                      {"button": {"name": "BtnReset", "h": "$size.button", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_RESET", "edge": "$bad", "color": "$bad"}},
                      {"hbox": {"name": "ResReloadRow", "h": "$size.button", "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnReload", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_RELOAD", "edge": "$alert", "color": "$alert"}},
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnRefresh", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_OV_REFRESH"}}
                      ]}},
                      {"text": {"name": "RzSummary", "w": 340, "h": 60, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "tiny", "color": "$muted",
                        "text": "-",
                        "note": "What the editor holds: how many files came, how many entries each, the draft's state."}},
                      {"text": {"name": "ResStatics", "w": 340, "h": "fill", "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "tiny", "color": "$muted",
                        "text": "statics: -",
                        "note": "The static spawner's line: entries with spawned/pending, or the reason auto-spawn is off."}}
                    ]}}
                  ]}}
                ]}},

              {"frame": {"name": "RzPage_points", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "hidden": true,
                "note": "Point types (the lines): the list on the left, the picked one's fields on the right. Every field writes the draft as it is typed; ADD and DELETE change the list.",
                "children": [
                  {"hbox": {"name": "RzPtCols", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "gap": "$space.column", "children": [
                    {"vbox": {"name": "RzPtListCol", "w": 440, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "RzPtHead", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_HEAD", "font": "small", "color": "$accent"}},
                      {"listbox": {"name": "RzPtList", "h": "fill", "font": "field", "color": "$text",
                        "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 12}}}
                    ]}},
                    {"vbox": {"name": "RzPtForm", "w": 500, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "RzPtPicked", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_PICK", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzPtIdLbl", "w": 150, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_ID", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzPtId", "w": 350}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzPtNameLbl", "w": 150, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_NAME", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzPtName", "w": 350}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzPtColorLbl", "w": 150, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_COLOR", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzPtColor", "w": 350}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzPtSortLbl", "w": 150, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_SORT", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzPtSort", "w": 350}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzPtPurityLbl", "w": 150, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_PURITY", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzPtPurity", "w": 350}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzPtIconLbl", "w": 150, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_ICON", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzPtIcon", "w": 350}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hbox": {"name": "RzPtBtns", "h": "$size.button", "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnRzPtAdd", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_ADD", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}},
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnRzPtDel", "w": "fill", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_DEL", "edge": "$bad", "color": "$bad"}}
                      ]}},
                      {"text": {"name": "RzPtNote", "w": 500, "h": "fill", "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "tiny", "color": "$muted",
                        "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PT_NOTE"}}
                    ]}}
                  ]}}
                ]}},

              {"frame": {"name": "RzPage_tree", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "hidden": true,
                "note": "The tree of one owner's branch, drawn with that owner's skin the way the player's window draws it (OZL_TreePlan, OZL_TreeLines, the skin's node layout), from the draft. Owners and branches on the left, the canvas in the middle, the picked node's fields on the right. The script sizes RzTrScroll and RzTrContent; the window's resize moves the columns (OnWindowResized).",
                "children": [
                  {"hbox": {"name": "RzTrCols", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "gap": 12, "children": [
                    {"vbox": {"name": "RzTrSide", "w": 200, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "RzTrOwnHead", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TR_OWNERS", "font": "small", "color": "$accent"}},
                      {"listbox": {"name": "RzTrOwners", "h": 170, "font": "field", "color": "$text",
                        "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 7}}},
                      {"label": {"name": "RzTrBrHead", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TR_BRANCHES", "font": "small", "color": "$accent"}},
                      {"listbox": {"name": "RzTrBranches", "h": "fill", "font": "field", "color": "$text",
                        "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 6}}}
                    ]}},
                    {"vbox": {"name": "RzTrMid", "w": 446, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                      {"hbox": {"name": "RzTrBar", "h": 28, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTrSkin", "w": "fill", "text": "-", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnRzTrRoot", "w": 110, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TR_ROOT", "font": "small", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}},
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnRzTrChild", "w": 130, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TR_CHILD", "font": "small", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}}
                      ]}},
                      {"frame": {"name": "RzTrHost", "h": "fill", "children": [
                        {"raw": {"name": "RzTrScroll", "class": "ScrollWidgetClass", "at": [0, 0], "size": [446, 348], "color": "$edge",
                          "props": {"clipchildren": 1, "Scrollbar V": 1, "Scrollbar H": 1, "style": "blank"},
                          "note": "The canvas: two-axis scroll, pencil scrollbars as in the player's windows. The script sizes it with the window and RzTrContent with the plan.",
                          "children": [
                            {"frame": {"name": "RzTrContent", "at": [0, 0], "size": [434, 336], "children": [
                              {"raw": {"name": "RzTrLines", "class": "CanvasWidgetClass", "size": "fill", "props": {"ignorepointer": 1},
                                "note": "Grid and links, drawn by OZL_TreeLines with the owner's skin."}},
                              {"frame": {"name": "RzTrNodes", "size": "fill",
                                "note": "One node cell of the skin per node, placed by the plan; each cell's NodeHit is renamed rznode:<id>."}}
                            ]}}
                          ]}}
                      ]}}
                    ]}},
                    {"vbox": {"name": "RzTrInsp", "w": 290, "gap": 4, "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "RzTnHead", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_PICK", "font": "small", "color": "$accent"}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnIdLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_ID", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnId", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnNameLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_NAME", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnName", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnTierLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_TIER", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnTier", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnParentsLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_PARENTS", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnParents", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnModeLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_MODE", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"button": {"name": "BtnRzTnMode", "w": 210, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_ALL", "font": "small"}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnCostLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_COST", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnCost", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnItemsLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_ITEMS", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnItems", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnTimeLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_TIME", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnTime", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                        {"label": {"name": "RzTnIconLbl", "w": 80, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_ICON", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                        {"field": {"name": "RzTnIcon", "w": 210}}
                      ]}},
                      {"button": {"name": "BtnRzTnDel", "h": "$size.button", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_DEL", "font": "small", "edge": "$bad", "color": "$bad"}},
                      {"text": {"name": "RzTnNote", "w": 290, "h": "fill", "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "tiny", "color": "$muted",
                        "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_TN_NOTE"}}
                    ]}}
                  ]}}
                ]}},

              {"frame": {"name": "RzPage_soon", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "hidden": true,
                "note": "Every sub-tab whose page is not written yet shows this one.",
                "children": [
                  {"text": {"name": "RzSoonText", "w": 960, "h": 120, "plain": true, "grow": false, "font": "body", "color": "$muted",
                    "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_SOON"}}
                ]}},

              {"frame": {"name": "RzPage_problems", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "hidden": true,
                "note": "What the server's own checks will say about the draft (Validate and Check of the seven files), shown by the problems button over the open page.",
                "children": [
                  {"vbox": {"name": "RzProbCol", "w": "fill", "h": "fill", "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                    {"label": {"name": "RzProbHead", "h": "$size.hint", "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PROB_HEAD", "font": "small", "color": "$accent"}},
                    {"listbox": {"name": "RzProbList", "h": "fill", "font": "field", "color": "$text",
                      "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 12}}}
                  ]}}
                ]}}
            ]}},

          {"hbox": {"name": "RzBar", "h": 28, "gap": 6,
            "note": "The draft's state on the left, its actions on the right. The script writes the counts into RzStatus, BtnRzProblems and BtnRzApply.",
            "children": [
              {"label": {"name": "RzStatus", "w": "fill", "text": "-", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnRzProblems", "w": 190, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_PROB_NONE", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnRzUndo", "w": 120, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_BTN_UNDO", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnRzRedo", "w": 120, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_BTN_REDO", "font": "small"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnRzDiscard", "w": 120, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_BTN_DISCARD", "font": "small", "edge": "$bad", "color": "$bad"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnRzApply", "w": 160, "text": "#STR_OZL_ED_BTN_APPLY", "font": "small", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}}
            ]}},

          {"label": {"name": "ResHint", "h": "$size.hint", "font": "hint", "color": "$muted"}}
        ]}}
    ]}}
}
